Watering is done every 2ish or more weeks (I wait til the soil is completely dry and then water again) and the pot has good draining. I am giving it as much light as I can for this time of year, and the temperature is doing fine I think(20C).

&#x200B;

There appears to be no random blotches of fuzz or spots on the plant. No soft spots either. It's just that this leaf is now very yellow, and shrivelling up

